---
// Section 2: Four Core Pillars Bento Grid with GSAP ScrollTrigger reveals
---

<section id="initiatives" class="w-full py-16 sm:py-24 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-canvas">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto space-y-10 sm:space-y-14">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="reveal-item flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-6 pb-6 border-b border-ink-200">
      <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-3">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-lime-subtle border border-lime-accent/50 text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-dark font-bold">
          <span>02 / Four Working Pillars</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold text-ink-900 tracking-tight leading-[1.12]">
          Programs designed for living realities, not exam competition.
        </h2>
      </div>

      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-ink-600 max-w-sm leading-relaxed">
        YP Nexus operates across interconnected initiatives fostering alternative schooling, ecological leadership, documentary archives, and community habitats.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- ── THE 4-CELL BENTO GRID ── -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-6 sm:gap-8">
      
      <!-- Card 1: Paryay Dschool (Featured Anchor Card - 7 Columns) -->
      <div class="reveal-item reveal-delay-1 md:col-span-7 bg-white rounded-3xl sm:rounded-4xl p-6 sm:p-10 border border-ink-200/80 shadow-card flex flex-col justify-between group hover:border-lime-accent transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="space-y-5">
          
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider bg-lime-accent text-ink-900">
              Flagship School
            </span>
            <a 
              href="#paryay-dschool" 
              class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-canvas border border-ink-200 flex items-center justify-center text-ink-900 group-hover:bg-lime-accent group-hover:border-lime-accent transition-colors"
              aria-label="View Paryay Dschool"
            >
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M7 17L17 7M17 7H7M17 7V17" />
              </svg>
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-1.5">
            <h3 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-ink-900 tracking-tight">
              Paryay Dschool
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-brand-forest uppercase tracking-wider font-mono">
              Multilingual, Multi-Board Open Learning Sanctuary
            </p>
          </div>

          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-ink-700 leading-relaxed">
            Here children develop independent life capabilities without artificial walls of standards, age-groups, or sex. Work is guided by experienced mentors at a 1:6 ratio, with direct board validation through NIOS and MsBOS.
          </p>

          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-1">
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-lg text-xs font-semibold bg-canvas text-ink-800 border border-ink-200">
              ✓ 1:6 Mentor-Learner Ratio
            </span>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-lg text-xs font-semibold bg-canvas text-ink-800 border border-ink-200">
              ✓ Monthly Joint Progress Reviews
            </span>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-lg text-xs font-semibold bg-canvas text-ink-800 border border-ink-200">
              ✓ Experiential Study Tours
            </span>
          </div>

        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden aspect-[16/9] border border-ink-200/80 bg-earth-100">
          <img 
            src="/images/ypnexus-hero-mobile.jpg" 
            alt="Paryay Dschool Mentoring in Pune" 
            class="anim-parallax-img w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700" 
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: PiSELT Leadership & Research (5 Columns) -->
      <div class="reveal-item reveal-delay-2 md:col-span-5 bg-brand-dark text-white rounded-3xl sm:rounded-4xl p-6 sm:p-10 border border-ink-800 shadow-card flex flex-col justify-between group hover:border-lime-accent transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="space-y-5">
          
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider bg-white/10 text-lime-accent border border-white/20">
              Leadership &amp; Research
            </span>
            <a 
              href="#contact" 
              class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-white/10 border border-white/20 flex items-center justify-center text-white group-hover:bg-lime-accent group-hover:text-ink-900 group-hover:border-lime-accent transition-colors"
              aria-label="View PiSELT"
            >
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M7 17L17 7M17 7H7M17 7V17" />
              </svg>
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-1.5">
            <h3 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">
              PiSELT Institute
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-lime-accent uppercase tracking-wider font-mono">
              Socio-Ecological Leadership
            </p>
          </div>

          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-white/80 leading-relaxed">
            Capacity-building programs, watershed audits, tailored field research, and livelihood strengthening designed to support grassroots communities and civic institutions.
          </p>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 flex items-center gap-4">
            <div class="text-3xl font-display font-black text-lime-accent">100%</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-white/70 leading-snug">
              Field-level empirical research without corporate or exam agendas.
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden aspect-[16/10] border border-white/10 bg-brand-forest">
          <img 
            src="/images/piselt-field.jpg" 
            alt="PiSELT Field Research in Western Ghats" 
            class="anim-parallax-img w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700" 
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- Card 3: TurTle Media (5 Columns) -->
      <div class="reveal-item reveal-delay-1 md:col-span-5 bg-white rounded-3xl sm:rounded-4xl p-6 sm:p-10 border border-ink-200/80 shadow-card flex flex-col justify-between group hover:border-lime-accent transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="space-y-5">
          
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider bg-canvas text-ink-800 border border-ink-200">
              Audio-Visual Production
            </span>
            <a 
              href="#contact" 
              class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-canvas border border-ink-200 flex items-center justify-center text-ink-900 group-hover:bg-lime-accent group-hover:border-lime-accent transition-colors"
              aria-label="View TurTle Media"
            >
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M7 17L17 7M17 7H7M17 7V17" />
              </svg>
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-1.5">
            <h3 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-ink-900 tracking-tight">
              TurTle Media
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-brand-forest uppercase tracking-wider font-mono">
              Ecological Audio-Visuals &amp; Publishing
            </p>
          </div>

          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-ink-700 leading-relaxed">
            Documenting ecological alternatives, citizen models, biodiversity corridors, and learner study tours into accessible documentaries, broadcasts, and print publications.
          </p>

        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden aspect-[16/10] border border-ink-200/80 bg-earth-50">
          <img 
            src="/images/turtle-documentary.jpg" 
            alt="TurTle Media Filmmaking in Agro-Ecological Field" 
            class="anim-parallax-img w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700" 
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- Card 4: BalMitee & Habitat (7 Columns) -->
      <div class="reveal-item reveal-delay-2 md:col-span-7 bg-lime-subtle rounded-3xl sm:rounded-4xl p-6 sm:p-10 border border-lime-accent/60 shadow-card flex flex-col justify-between group hover:border-brand-forest transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="space-y-5">
          
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider bg-white text-brand-dark border border-lime-accent">
              Community &amp; Habitat
            </span>
            <a 
              href="#contact" 
              class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-white border border-lime-accent/80 flex items-center justify-center text-ink-900 group-hover:bg-brand-dark group-hover:text-white transition-colors"
              aria-label="View Habitat Work"
            >
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M7 17L17 7M17 7H7M17 7V17" />
              </svg>
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-1.5">
            <h3 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-brand-dark tracking-tight">
              BalMitee &amp; Ecological Habitats
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-brand-forest uppercase tracking-wider font-mono">
              Ecosystems • Formative Learning • Native Soil Protection
            </p>
          </div>

          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-ink-800 leading-relaxed">
            Connecting young children in their formative years to native soil, organic biodiversity, and living neighborhoods. Creating learning sanctuaries where children freely explore without artificial classroom confinement.
          </p>

          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-1">
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-lg text-xs font-semibold bg-white text-ink-800 border border-lime-accent/40">
              🌿 Native Flora &amp; Soil Sensitization
            </span>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-lg text-xs font-semibold bg-white text-ink-800 border border-lime-accent/40">
              🏘️ Neighborhood Living Spaces
            </span>
          </div>

        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden aspect-[16/9] border border-lime-accent/50 bg-white">
          <img 
            src="/images/balmitee-habitat.jpg" 
            alt="BalMitee children planting saplings" 
            class="anim-parallax-img w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700" 
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
